---
import { siteMetadata } from '../data/site';
---
<section id="contact" class="reveal px-6 py-20">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl space-y-6 rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 p-8">
    <div>
      <div class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.4em] text-muted">
        <span class="lang lang-es">Contacto</span>
        <span class="lang lang-en">Contact</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="mt-3 text-2xl font-semibold text-offwhite">
        <span class="lang lang-es">Afrontemos el próximo sprint juntos.</span>
        <span class="lang lang-en">Let’s tackle the next sprint together.</span>
      </h2>
    </div>
    <p class="text-base text-offwhite/80 lang lang-es">
      Estoy disponible para colaboraciones enfocadas que demandan ciclos de retroalimentación rápidos,
      pensamiento de producto sólido y entregas pulidas.
    </p>
    <p class="text-base text-offwhite/80 lang lang-en">
      I make myself available for focused collaborations that demand fast feedback loops, reliable
      product thinking, and polished delivery.
    </p>
    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-accent">
      <a
        class="rounded-full border border-white/20 px-5 py-3 transition hover:border-blue-400"
        href={`mailto:${siteMetadata.email}`}
      >
        Email
      </a>
      <a
        class="rounded-full border border-white/20 px-5 py-3 transition hover:border-blue-400"
        href={siteMetadata.linkedin}
        rel="noopener"
        target="_blank"
      >
        LinkedIn
      </a>
      <a
        class="rounded-full border border-white/20 px-5 py-3 transition hover:border-blue-400"
        href={siteMetadata.github}
        rel="noopener"
        target="_blank"
      >
        GitHub
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
